      "en": [
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "אָמֵן. יְהֵא שְׁמֵהּ רַבָּא מְבָרַךְ לְעָלַם וּלְעָלְמֵי עָלְמַיָּא—(We all enthusiastically respond:) Absolutely correct! May everyone (including me!), everywhere, and forever, see that all His actions are great and deserving of praise!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "יִתְבָּרַךְ וְיִשְׁתַּבַּח—(The chazzan then points out that) in reality, the true greatness and power of Hashem far exceeds any praises that we mere humans could say. And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely correct!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "תִּתְקַבֵּל צְלוֹתְהוֹן—(The chazzan requests:) May the tefillos and requests of all of Bnei Yisrael be accepted by You! And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely, we agree!"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 0
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "יְהֵא שְׁלָמָא רַבָּא—(The chazzan requests:) May there be abundant peace that comes from Heaven, and life, upon us and upon all of Bnei Yisrael! And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely, we agree!"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 1
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "עוֹשֶׂה שָׁלוֹם בִּמְרוֹמָיו—(The chazzan requests:) May He Who makes peace in the Heavens bring about peace upon us and upon all of Bnei Yisrael! And to that we respond: אָמֵן—Absolutely, we agree!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "עָלֵינוּ לְשַׁבֵּחַ לַאֲדוֹן הַכֹּל—We feel that it is our obligation to praise Hashem, the Creator of the world, for giving us a unique position among all peoples of the world! We have a very special relationship with Hashem, a unique mission with a clear set of responsibilities and a unique eternal destiny, which no other nation has! They serve gods and powers that are empty and ineffective; וַאֲנַחְנוּ כּוֹרְעִים וּמִשְׁתַּחֲוִים—while we submit ourselves to the King of all Kings; הַקָּדוֹשׁ בָּרוּךְ הוּא—Who is both above our understanding (הַקָּדוֹשׁ—His Presence is in the Heavens) and at the same time, He is also the Source of everything here on earth (בָּרוּךְ הוּא)!"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 3
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "הוּא אֱלֹהֵינוּ אֵין עוֹד—Hashem is OUR personal God, there is no other power that controls us; אֱמֶת מַלְכֵּנוּ, אֶפֶס זוּלָתוֹ—Hashem our King is true, there is nothing beside Him. As the pasuk says: \"You must know today and take to heart that Hashem alone is our God; in the Heavens above and on the earth below; אֵין עוֹד—there is nothing else (but Hashem)!\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "עַל כֵּן נְקַוֶּה לְּךָ—Therefore, we hope that soon we will see Your power and glory when You destroy all of society's false gods, and all of humanity will recognize Your Presence, and all the wicked will submit to You and accept the yoke of Your Kingdom; and You will rule over the whole world; soon and forever!"
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 5
        },
        {
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "וְנֶאֱמַר—As the pasuk says: \"Then Hashem will be the King over the entire earth; on that day Hashem will be One (everyone will realize there is no other power but Hashem), and His Name will be One (everyone will realize that all that has happened since creation is all good, and all came from Hashem as part of one unified plan).\""
            }
          ],
          "anchorLine": 7
        }
      ],
      "_legacySource": null
